**Folder slug (HARD):** `plan_id` = stem plan-файла без `plan-` (со descriptive slug). **FORBIDDEN** short queue id в имени папки при `plan-<id>-<slug>.md`. Канон: @.cursor/rules/shared/epic-scoped-paths.mdc §Folder naming.

